                        "entry_id": "2d0e7020-7133-36d6-8168-069566ee204b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Not remunerative."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e2fa5731-a8fd-4640-b0e1-c47aa83add66",
                                "sense_id": "5a2c53f4-a46f-38f7-b6f1-bb894c9f40c1",
                                "text": "Such a comparatively unremunerative occupation as that of carrying a few score head of cattle six times a year from Port Zodiac to Port Marivelles was not worth a ship-owner's thought […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5e157236-1b2c-4854-a61a-2f5508a77484",
                                "sense_id": "5a2c53f4-a46f-38f7-b6f1-bb894c9f40c1",
                                "text": "It is particularly desirable to obtain photographs of rural stations, both with and without a train, in view of the threatened wholesale closure of unremunerative branches throughout the country."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "926cd133-f05c-421d-9e08-508f486214ef",
                                "sense_id": "5a2c53f4-a46f-38f7-b6f1-bb894c9f40c1",
                                "text": "A very interesting development in the realm of local transport is the completion of an independent enquiry into transport services in rural areas, with particular reference to the closure of unremunerative branch lines and connections between bus and train services."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
